+ * from the last line to line 0, and bit 31 follows the line being scanned
+ * out: in 480-line interlace the field being displayed (0 in vblank), else
+ * the scanline's own parity, both offset by the display area's Y (GP1(05h)).
+ * DuckStation ffb33c28 (GPU::UpdateCRTC... read for behaviour only) does the
